From 1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Auto-fix <auto-fix@yocto>
Date: Mon, 27 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Python imp module compatibility

The 'imp' module was deprecated in Python 3.4 and removed in Python 3.12.
Replace with 'importlib' which is the recommended replacement.

This fixes the error:
  ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'imp'

Signed-off-by: Auto-fix <auto-fix@yocto>

---
 waflib/Context.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/waflib/Context.py b/waflib/Context.py
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/waflib/Context.py
+++ b/waflib/Context.py
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
 # Thomas Nagy, 2005-2018 (ita)
 
 import os, re, imp, sys
+import os, re, importlib, sys
 import waflib.Utils as Utils
 import waflib.Logs as Logs
 import waflib.Options as Options
